          },
          {
            "sourceIndex": 3,
            "text": "Press garlic using a garlic press. Mix the cheese and garlic together.",
            "mediaId": null
          },
          {
            "sourceIndex": 4,
            "text": "Add mayonnaise, finely chopped herbs and tomato pulp. Salt and pepper to taste. Mix well.",
